---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
const pageTitle = "About"
import headshot from "../img/cropped.png"
const imgWidth = 200

---
<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
	<p>
	An auto-prebituary. "Just for me", I say, on a public website. If you are looking for high-quality internet content I suggest you visit <a href="/switchboard">/switchboard</a> which is certain to be more worth your time. </p>

	I'll fill in the following sections in time.

	<h2>Upbringing</h2>

	<h2>Beliefs</h2>

	<h2>Goals</h2>

	<h2>Relationships</h2>
		<div>
			<Image src={headshot} alt="Here is what I look like" width={imgWidth} loading="lazy"/>
		</div>
		<p>Here is what I look like. </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    #aboutSection {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        gap: 5rem;
        align-content: space-evenly;
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        #aboutSection {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
            align-content: space-evenly;
        }

  }
</style>
   
